{"batch":1314,"files":[{"name":"18e3cefce996.mp3","text":"彼は経験不足だ。","sha256":"9b144a5e03739c7f689cfb4f67e93f8fedfd39afacb06b97fd93fee3c3ed2143","size":9597},{"name":"19a0ac0cce77.mp3","text":"彼は自分の語学力の源として、幼少期からたくさんの競走馬の名前を覚えていたことを挙げた。","sha256":"d1b95ed6a9d9d7b5b5619c7929225ecabac78c945812361ec897f3190428257d","size":41277},{"name":"19cfc7439cbd.mp3","text":"彼は約束を果たす。","sha256":"21ac33a6f00ddcc2eebc91064caf6359e211630a8024424bff80b72cf0bc99c3","size":9597},{"name":"1afe7df5958c.mp3","text":"彼は腰が重くてなかなか動かない。","sha256":"d6009958ebe049d8108aad6d6dd0c030c9a84046c552f97f773016c51cc9729f","size":14781},{"name":"1bdfadbb317c.mp3","text":"彼は粘り強い精神の持ち主だ。","sha256":"33fdcb68fe1a8013893068e883b03bf7484c9bce04b29da48dfb8b0ffde003ba","size":14781},{"name":"28350520dff2.mp3","text":"彼は群衆に向かって厳かに語りかけた。","sha256":"da999d52d90d33faafe77bcf08d6211efdb0929591c6ac81331fa0247cad367c","size":17661},{"name":"2cd3796b95a2.mp3","text":"彼は脱兎のごとく逃げた。","sha256":"ede06b009704ba1938b567d89923873749c2435140c5f6503a0d4f3a2a53f9c6","size":10749},{"name":"2e0b3f0fde06.mp3","text":"彼は義務を固く守る。","sha256":"e762df8d7d2e77ec339d7bfddbedeb5954564322b9ec2331b4b3a2ef5d87e17a","size":10173},{"name":"337caa14b5b3.mp3","text":"彼は森のほうへ逃走した。","sha256":"c8c0b9a0707ff167d7523e267478ef6cbdf969f1fa6f7401922188e24dd72328","size":12333},{"name":"38f46ffe31bc.mp3","text":"彼は海水から塩を結晶させて取り出した。","sha256":"ce49913c3d9598bc7da5cc25564c352ca598c18f1aff7deda6fe7ad32446c3c5","size":18237}]}
